            "text": "Vulnerability found\n\nThe contract function airDrop uses the msg.sender address directly as the object reference, bypassing proper authorization checks.\n\nImpact: An attacker can manipulate the balance of any contract that supports the Nu Token by calling airDrop while having a zero balance.\n\nRemediation: Implement proper access controls or use indirect object references."
